## Own-business use

You may use, copy and modify the software, including for commercial
purposes, to create images for products, shops, brands or businesses
that you own or operate, or that your employer owns or operates when you
act for your employer. You may use, publish, sell and otherwise exploit
the images you create this way commercially, without further permission
from the licensor.

## Not covered

This permission does not cover, and you need a separate written
commercial license from the licensor for:

- selling, renting, sublicensing or distributing the software, its
  prompts or works based on them for a fee, or as part of a paid
  product or bundle;
- offering the software, its prompts or their functionality to others
  as a paid tool, hosted service or API;
- creating images for other people or businesses for a fee or other
  commercial consideration (for example as an agency, studio,
  freelancer or store operator);
- using the software or its prompts as material for paid courses or
  training.

Third-party materials named in `assets/examples/README.md` keep their
own terms. If a translation of this permission differs from this English
text, this English text governs.

